### fuel-reserves--2026-10-02-g7-releases-100-million-barrels-2026-10-03-r3-redteam.md 
 1. **Major · new.** Page bytes: “G7 will release 100 million barrels over four months, **counting commitments already fulfilled**.” The timeline also says the statement “counts commitments already fulfilled.” The pinned [G7 statement](/Volumes/4/GitHub/the-catch-site-wt-fuel/data/sources/fuel-reserves/govuk-g7-statement-2026-10-02.txt:5) says “taking into account commitments that have already been fulfilled” and describes a 100 million barrel release “to begin immediately over 4 months.” It does not say fulfilled barrels are included in that 100 million. **Correct account:** The G7 took fulfilled commitments into account when setting the release; the amount of overlap with March remains unspecified.

