3. **Minor · new.** Page bytes: “Diesel export ban status” followed by “The leaders also said that there would be no ban on diesel exports between them,” credited to “France 24.” The pinned [G7 statement](/Volumes/4/GitHub/the-catch-site-wt-fuel/data/sources/fuel-reserves/govuk-g7-statement-2026-10-02.txt:6) itself says members reaffirmed their commitment to refrain from export restrictions on energy and energy products between G7 countries. **Correct account:** Credit the G7 statement for the pledge; France 24 is reporting the same decision.

